.TH man 1 "2026-10-15" "0.19.0" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH NAME
/mam

.SH DESCRIPTION
Enable or disable Message Archive Management (XEP-0313), or verify loaded history. Use the PG UP key to load more history.

.SH SYNOPSIS
/mam <on>|<off>

.LP
/mam verify

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fBon|off\fR
.RS 4
Enable or disable MAM
.RE
.PP
\fBverify\fR
.RS 4
Verify history between the oldest and newest loaded messages in the current window and fetch any missing ones from the server
.RE
